---
import CopyButton from '../../components/CopyButton.svelte';

const { lang } = Astro.props;
---
<section id="get">
    <div class="container fade-up">
        {lang === 'en' ? (
            <>
            <div class="section-label">Get 𝚅𝚒𝚋𝚎𝚌𝚛𝚊𝚏𝚝𝚎𝚍.</div>
            <h2 class="section-title">Install the framework. Start the loop.</h2>
            <p class="section-sub">Bootstrap the control plane, verify your local surface, and enter the first founder-grade workflow with the new command deck.</p>
            </>
        ) : (
            <>
            <div class="section-label">Pobierz 𝚅𝚒𝚋𝚎𝚌𝚛𝚊𝚏𝚝𝚎𝚍.</div>
            <h2 class="section-title">Zainstaluj framework. Uruchom pętlę.</h2>
            <p class="section-sub">Zbootstrapuj control plane, zweryfikuj lokalną powierzchnię i wejdź w pierwszy workflow klasy założycielskiej z nowym command deckiem.</p>
            </>
        )}
        <div class="docs-grid docs-grid--steps">
            <article class="docs-card docs-card--install">
                <div class="docs-card__step" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
                <div class="docs-card__copy">
                    {lang === 'en' ? (
                        <>
                        <h3>Bootstrap the control plane</h3>
                        <p>Stage the framework locally and let the installer walk through the real environment before it touches the system.</p>
                        </>
                    ) : (
                        <>
                        <h3>Zbootstrapuj control plane</h3>
                        <p>Zainstaluj framework lokalnie i pozwól instalatorowi przejść przez realne środowisko, zanim dotknie systemu.</p>
                        </>
                    )}
                </div>
                <div class="docs-card__command docs-card__command--bar">
                    <div class="install-command-bar">
                        <span class="install-command-bar__prompt">$</span>
                        <code class="install-command-bar__code">curl -fsSL https://vibecrafted.io/install.sh | bash</code>
                        <CopyButton client:visible class="cb-copy install-command-bar__copy" textToCopy="curl -fsSL https://vibecrafted.io/install.sh | bash" defaultLabel={lang === 'en' ? "COPY" : "KOPIUJ"} />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
            <article class="docs-card docs-card--install">
                <div class="docs-card__step" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
                <div class="docs-card__copy">
                    {lang === 'en' ? (
                        <>
                        <h3>Enter through the command deck</h3>
                        <p>The main front door is now <code>vibecrafted</code>. Daily skill surfaces are exposed as direct <code>vc-*</code> commands.</p>
                        </>
                    ) : (
                        <>
                        <h3>Wejdź przez command deck</h3>
                        <p>Główne drzwi wejściowe to teraz <code>vibecrafted</code>. Codzienne powierzchnie skilli są dostępne jako bezpośrednie komendy <code>vc-*</code>.</p>
                        </>
                    )}
                </div>
                <div class="docs-card__command docs-card__command--bar">
                    <div class="install-command-bar">
                        <span class="install-command-bar__prompt">$</span>
                        <code class="install-command-bar__code">vibecrafted help &amp;&amp; vibecrafted init claude</code>
                        <CopyButton client:visible class="cb-copy install-command-bar__copy" textToCopy="vibecrafted help &amp;&amp; vibecrafted init claude" defaultLabel={lang === 'en' ? "COPY" : "KOPIUJ"} />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
            <article class="docs-card docs-card--install">
                <div class="docs-card__step" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
                <div class="docs-card__copy">
                    {lang === 'en' ? (
                        <>
                        <h3>Drive the real work</h3>
                        <p>Examine the codebase, research ground truth, and delegate implementation to parallel agents &mdash; all in one pipeline.</p>
                        </>
                    ) : (
                        <>
                        <h3>Napędzaj prawdziwą pracę</h3>
                        <p>Zbadaj codebase, researchu ground truth i deleguj implementację do równoległych agentów &mdash; wszystko w jednym pipeline.</p>
                        </>
                    )}
                </div>
                <div class="docs-card__command docs-card__command--bar">
                    <div class="install-command-bar">
                        <span class="install-command-bar__prompt">$</span>
                        <code class="install-command-bar__code">vibecrafted workflow claude --prompt "Plan and implement auth module"</code>
                        <CopyButton client:visible class="cb-copy install-command-bar__copy" textToCopy='vibecrafted workflow claude --prompt "Plan and implement auth module"' defaultLabel={lang === 'en' ? "COPY" : "KOPIUJ"} />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
            <article class="docs-card docs-card--install">
                <div class="docs-card__step" aria-hidden="true">04</div>
                <div class="docs-card__copy">
                    {lang === 'en' ? (
                        <>
                        <h3>Converge until it stops lying</h3>
                        <p>The marbles loop finds what is still wrong and eliminates it. Each pass sharpens the surface.</p>
                        </>
                    ) : (
                        <>
                        <h3>Konwerguj aż przestanie kłamać</h3>
                        <p>Pętla marbles znajduje to, co wciąż jest źle i eliminuje to. Każde przejście wyostrza powierzchnię.</p>
                        </>
                    )}
                </div>
                <div class="docs-card__command docs-card__command--bar">
                    <div class="install-command-bar">
                        <span class="install-command-bar__prompt">$</span>
                        <code class="install-command-bar__code">vibecrafted marbles codex --count 3 --depth 3</code>
                        <CopyButton client:visible class="cb-copy install-command-bar__copy" textToCopy="vibecrafted marbles codex --count 3 --depth 3" defaultLabel={lang === 'en' ? "COPY" : "KOPIUJ"} />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
        </div>
        <div class="docs-inline-links">
            {lang === 'en' ? (
                <>
                <a data-astro-reload data-modal-open="quickstart-modal" href="/en/quickstart/">Quick Start</a>
                <a data-astro-reload data-modal-open="faq-modal" href="/en/faq/">FAQ</a>
                <a href="https://github.com/VetCoders/vibecrafted">GitHub</a>
                </>
            ) : (
                <>
                <a data-astro-reload data-modal-open="quickstart-modal" href="/pl/quickstart/">Szybki start</a>
                <a data-astro-reload data-modal-open="faq-modal" href="/pl/faq/">FAQ</a>
                <a href="https://github.com/VetCoders/vibecrafted">GitHub</a>
                </>
            )}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
